# F13 Share cards & Keepsakes (Milestone C; PRD 06a "F13 Share cards &
# Keepsakes", contracts/api/v1-keepsakes.md, RULES.md §11). Loaded by
# tool/l10n_source.py.
# s(key, en, desc, te, te_Latn, ph=None, hi=, hl=)
#
# te / te_Latn / hi / hi_Latn (hl) are first drafts: NEEDS NATIVE REVIEW before launch.
#
# Rules: keepsakes are earned, private and calm. Never a count toward the next
# one, never "locked", "unlock", "next", "progress", "almost", "don't lose",
# never a streak. The box shows only what was kept. Share cards never carry a
# mood, a note, a name or a date (the day a seal was kept shows only inside
# the private box). Hindi first-person lines use "maine … kiya" (the verb
# agrees with the object, never the speaker's gender).

